"object.user_id.name)\">[Recipient Name]</t>,<br/><br/>\n"
"                    We have assigned a company expense card to you.\n"
"                    You can view and manage it anytime by going to My "
"Profile and selecting the Cards section.<br/><br/>\n"
"                    If you have any questions, feel free to reach out.<br/"
"><br/>\n"
"                    Best regards,<br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.ordered_by.name or ''\">[Expense "
"Administrator]</t>\n"
"                    </td></tr>\n"
"                    <tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\">\n"
"                    <hr width=\"100%\" style=\"background-"
